      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the node conditions and status. The <code>conditions</code> stanza lists the <code>Ready</code>, <code>PIDPressure</code>, <code>MemoryPressure</code>, <code>DiskPressure</code> and <code>OutOfDisk</code> status. These condition are described later in this section.</p></dd>
